\n琳达为什么会在这种情况下感受到这些情绪？\n\n## 问题 2 的选项\nA) 她的朋友不喜欢她欣赏的秀\nB) 她的朋友真的很喜欢这个表演\nC) 年轻设计师的系列作品不好\nD) 琳达对邀请梅利莎感到抱歉，因为她很累","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.006690417617590184,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e8dfd6006945d280aa47","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794369759866,"createTime":"2026-11-11 12:02:39","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"39022b1ab6a4475aa582a1a73209d3d4"}